          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "package-authority",
          "text": "The frozen truth source must be resolver-selected `features/<slug>/{truth,tests,tasks,evidence}.md`; generated JSON, legacy triptych, provider graphs, and support research cannot win authority.",
